WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.903
-President Trump's ex-personal
fixer, Michael Cohen,

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.771
testified before Congress today.

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:08.341
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:12.912
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.448
We say this a lot,
but today was truly

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.583
one of the most eventful days
of the Trump presidency.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.853
It's not often you have one of
the president's

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.220
closest personal confidantes

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.523
testify before Congress about
their relationship.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.859
And Republicans
were clearly freaking out

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.626
about Cohen's testimony
in advance.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:30.263
One Republican Congressman,
Matt Gaetz,

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.164
tried to intimidate Cohen
on Twitter yesterday

00:00:32.164 --> 00:00:35.501
by threatening to reveal
sensitive personal information.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:36.869
-He tweeted this.

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:39.305
"Hey, Michael Cohen, do your
wife and father-in-law

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.773
know about your girlfriends?

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.509
Maybe tonight would be
a good time for that chat.

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:46.179
I wonder if she'll remain
faithful when you're in prison.

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:48.314
She's about to learn a lot."

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:51.417
-That's a congressman
saying that stuff!

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.686
Even if it was a Mafia thug,

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:57.723
the other Mafia thugs
would go, "Oh!

00:00:57.723 --> 00:01:01.493
Leave the guy's wife
out of this!"

00:01:01.493 --> 00:01:03.996
And I didn't think anyone
could outsleaze Donald Trump,

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:05.331
but you did it, my friend.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:08.735
You were trying to intimidate
a witness on Twitter.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.069
What's next?

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:11.537
Are you gonna Instagram
a photo of a brick

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:13.606
with a caption "about to throw
this through your window"?

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:14.807
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:17.343
Now, all of this --
All of this was happening

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:20.079
while Trump was in Vietnam
for his summit

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.614
with North Korean
leader Kim Jong-Un.

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:24.183
In fact, at one point,
Trump was asked a question

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:28.521
about the Cohen hearing with Kim
sitting right next to him.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:31.724
-Michael Cohen
and his testimony?

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.626
-Thank you.

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.795
-Look at Kim's face.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:41.267
I mean -- that is --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:47.339
Even he's like, "I'm so happy
I'm not Donald Trump right now!"

00:01:47.339 --> 00:01:48.975
Now, Republicans are
obviously desperate

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:51.411
to dismiss Cohen's testimony
as a sideshow.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:54.580
This morning Fox News host
Brian Kilmeade complained

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.450
that the other networks were
so obsessed with the hearing

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.485
because they have
countdown clocks.

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:00.887
-It's kind of amazing too --

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:02.922
another network
has a countdown clock,

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.357
not to Kim Jong-Un's dinner
and the negotiations

00:02:05.357 --> 00:02:06.692
with world peace at stake,

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:08.961
but to
Michael Cohen's testimony.

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:10.530
-That's right.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.031
Brian Kilmeade thinks it's dumb
to have a countdown clock.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.867
So it must have come as a shock
when the show right after

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:17.470
"fox &amp; Friends" immediately
put up a countdown clock.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:18.972
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.941
Maybe Brian Kilmeade doesn't
know what a clock looks like.

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.944
He thought those numbers
were the results of his IQ test.

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.780
Oh, no! Oh, it's going down!

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.682
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.184
Once the Cohen hearing
got underway,

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:32.919
the GOP-ranking member
of the committee,

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:35.021
Jim Jordan,
tried to make a motion,

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.790
presumably to delay or interfere
with the hearing.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:41.628
But he made the mistake
of yielding back his time first,

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.229
and the Democratic chairman
of the committee,

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:46.232
Elijah Cummings, wouldn't
let him have the time back.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.733
-Mr. Chairman?

00:02:47.733 --> 00:02:51.270
We are better than this.
We are better than this.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.006
I yield back.

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:57.143
-I wanted to note --

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:58.878
-Mr. Chairman, actually,
I have a motion.

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:02.748
-You yielded back.
-I have a motion.

00:03:02.748 --> 00:03:04.584
-The gentleman
is not being recognized.

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:07.286
-I have a motion under
rule 2k6 of rule 11.

00:03:07.286 --> 00:03:09.021
-You yielded back, sir.

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:11.657
-You yielded back.
-Amazing.

00:03:11.657 --> 00:03:13.526
He tried to throw a wrench
into the hearing

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:16.029
but accidentally
yielded his time.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:18.231
He forgot that the number-one
rule of Congress

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:20.966
is no takebacks.

00:03:20.966 --> 00:03:22.835
And then it came time for Cohen
to speak himself.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:25.171
Cohen wasted no time in going
after Trump personally

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.738
and directly
in his opening statement,

00:03:26.738 --> 00:03:28.374
and he touched on so many

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.342
of the central questions
surrounding the President.

00:03:30.342 --> 00:03:32.979
Everything from whether Trump
was aware of the e-mails

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:36.181
hacked during the campaign
to whether Trump had lied

00:03:36.181 --> 00:03:38.151
about plans
to build a Trump Tower in Moscow

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:40.453
to whether Trump personally
reimbursed him

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:42.521
for the hush payment
to Stormy Daniels.

00:03:42.521 --> 00:03:46.092
-He was a presidential candidate
who knew that Roger Stone

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:50.029
was talking with Julian Assange
about a WikiLeaks drop

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:52.798
on Democratic National
Committee e-mails.

00:03:52.798 --> 00:03:54.167
Mr. Trump knew of

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:57.337
and directed the Trump Moscow
negotiations

00:03:57.337 --> 00:04:01.106
throughout the campaign
and lied about it.

00:04:01.106 --> 00:04:04.443
He asked me to pay off
an adult film star

00:04:04.443 --> 00:04:08.715
with whom he had an affair
and to lie about it to his wife.

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:10.082
Which I did.

00:04:10.082 --> 00:04:13.252
A lot of people have asked me
about whether Mr. Trump

00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:16.154
knew about the release
of the hacked documents.

00:04:16.154 --> 00:04:21.193
The Democratic National
Committee e-mails ahead of time.

00:04:21.193 --> 00:04:24.363
And the answer is yes.
-Damn.

00:04:24.363 --> 00:04:26.899
He just listed off a bunch
of alleged crimes

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.234
committed by the President
on national TV.

00:04:29.234 --> 00:04:30.503
You know, it's so ironic.

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:32.238
Trump finally went to Vietnam,

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:34.374
and he's getting
killed back home.

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:36.675
[ Laughter ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:36.675 --> 00:04:41.114
In fact --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:46.185
In fact, Cohen even provided
a copy of a check

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:48.921
Trump personally signed
to pay off Stormy Daniels.

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:50.123
Look at that.

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:51.524
That is a check
the President wrote

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:53.493
while he was in office
to break election law

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:55.728
and cover up an affair,
and you can tell

00:04:55.728 --> 00:04:59.298
because it was signed by
President Imama-mama-ma.

00:04:59.298 --> 00:05:04.370
[ Laughter ]

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.705
Trump's signature looks like

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:07.306
he was trying to
draw a straight line

00:05:07.306 --> 00:05:09.041
while riding
a roller coaster.

00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:11.778
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:15.314
Now, before today, prosecutors
did not technically identify

00:05:15.314 --> 00:05:17.182
Trump as the person
who orchestrated

00:05:17.182 --> 00:05:18.250
the hush-money scheme.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.985
In court filings, prosecutors

00:05:19.985 --> 00:05:22.588
referred to him
only as Individual One.

00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:27.026
Although they did give us a clue
as to Individual One's identity.

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:30.929
On approximately June 16,
2015, Individual One began

00:05:30.929 --> 00:05:33.166
an ultimately
successful campaign

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:37.403
for President
of the United States.

00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:39.972
So everyone knew.

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:41.874
Everyone knew Individual One
was Trump.

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:44.576
And yet in his testimony,
Cohen still delivered it

00:05:44.576 --> 00:05:47.413
like it was some big,
dramatic reveal.

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:51.517
-Last fall, I pled guilty
in federal court

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:56.422
to felonies for the benefit
of, at the direction of,

00:05:56.422 --> 00:06:01.761
and in coordination
with Individual Number One.

00:06:01.761 --> 00:06:06.098
And for the record,
Individual Number One

00:06:06.098 --> 00:06:10.402
is President Donald J. Trump.

00:06:10.402 --> 00:06:11.804
-Donald Trump?

00:06:11.804 --> 00:06:12.805
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.805 --> 00:06:16.175
♪♪

00:06:16.175 --> 00:06:18.144
Ay, dios mio!

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:25.251
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:26.819
Cohen also provided
what he claimed

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:29.689
was an explanation for Trump's
behavior during the campaign.

00:06:29.689 --> 00:06:31.990
He never expected
to be president.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.126
He acted only in his own
personal interests,

00:06:34.126 --> 00:06:35.795
and that's because
he saw the campaign

00:06:35.795 --> 00:06:38.063
as an opportunity
to enrich himself.

00:06:38.063 --> 00:06:40.733
-Donald Trump is a man
who ran for office

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.968
to make his brand great.

00:06:42.968 --> 00:06:45.638
Not to make our country great.

00:06:45.638 --> 00:06:49.875
He had no desire or intention
to lead this nation.

00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:54.880
Only to market himself and
to build his wealth and power.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:57.049
Mr. Trump would often say

00:06:57.049 --> 00:06:59.485
this campaign was going to be

00:06:59.485 --> 00:07:03.189
the greatest infomercial
in political history.

00:07:03.189 --> 00:07:04.590
-It's true.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.425
And like any product
you buy from an infomercial,

00:07:06.425 --> 00:07:08.861
it turned out to be much
crappier than it looked on TV.

00:07:08.861 --> 00:07:09.962
[ Applause ]

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:13.265
Trump --
if we're being honest --

00:07:13.265 --> 00:07:16.569
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:16.569 --> 00:07:20.973
Donald Trump is
the Slanket of presidents.

00:07:20.973 --> 00:07:23.476
On TV you thought, "That's cool,
a blanket with sleeves."

00:07:23.476 --> 00:07:24.943
and now, two years later,
it's stained, shrinking,

00:07:24.943 --> 00:07:26.112
and filled with farts,

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:28.847
and you're like, "Get this thing
out of my house."

00:07:28.847 --> 00:07:30.782
And Cohen wasn't just there
to testify about

00:07:30.782 --> 00:07:32.084
the President's alleged crimes.

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:34.053
He also provided
information about everything

00:07:34.053 --> 00:07:36.521
from Trump's long history
of racism to his net worth.

00:07:36.521 --> 00:07:38.958
In fact, Cohen revealed
that even though Trump

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:40.359
waged a racist campaign

00:07:40.359 --> 00:07:42.795
to get President Obama
to release his college records,

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:45.664
he made Cohen
threaten Trump schools

00:07:45.664 --> 00:07:48.266
not to release his grades
and S.A.T. scores.

00:07:48.266 --> 00:07:52.671
-I'm talking about a man
who declares himself brilliant,

00:07:52.671 --> 00:07:55.607
but directed me to threaten
his high school,

00:07:55.607 --> 00:07:58.577
his colleges
and the college board

00:07:58.577 --> 00:08:02.547
to never release
his grades or S.A.T. scores.

00:08:02.547 --> 00:08:05.418
-I shudder to imagine
what Trump's S.A.T. score was.

00:08:05.418 --> 00:08:06.819
[ Laughter ]

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:10.522
"It had to be a perfect score.
I filled in every circle."

00:08:10.522 --> 00:08:12.725
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:18.063
Cohen also --
[ Applause ]

00:08:18.063 --> 00:08:20.466
Cohen also talked in depth
about the infamous Trump Tower

00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:22.335
meeting with the Russians
in June 2016.

00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:24.203
Again, Trump has claimed
he knew nothing

00:08:24.203 --> 00:08:26.772
about that meeting, which was
organized by his son Don Jr.

00:08:26.772 --> 00:08:29.642
Cohen said he suspected Trump
did know about the meeting,

00:08:29.642 --> 00:08:31.944
based on something he saw
happen in Trump Tower.

00:08:31.944 --> 00:08:34.046
-I remember being in a room
with Mr. Trump,

00:08:34.046 --> 00:08:37.450
probably in early June of 2016

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:40.219
when something
peculiar happened.

00:08:40.219 --> 00:08:41.753
Don Trump Jr.

00:08:41.753 --> 00:08:45.557
came into the room and walked
behind his father's desk,

00:08:45.557 --> 00:08:48.494
which in and of itself
was unusual.

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:53.098
People didn't just walk behind
Mr. Trump's desk to talk to him.

00:08:53.098 --> 00:08:54.900
And I recall Don Jr.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:59.205
leaning over to his father
and speaking in a low voice,

00:08:59.205 --> 00:09:01.540
which I could clearly hear,

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.943
and saying,
"The meeting is all set."

00:09:04.943 --> 00:09:08.480
And I remember Mr. Trump
saying, "Okay, good.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:09.982
Let me know."

00:09:09.982 --> 00:09:13.152
-He said it in a low voice
Cohen could clearly hear.

00:09:13.152 --> 00:09:15.321
These guys are too dumb
to whisper.

00:09:15.321 --> 00:09:16.422
[ Laughter ]

00:09:16.422 --> 00:09:19.625
"Hey, Dad,
I got an idea for a crime.

00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:21.293
Whisper!

00:09:21.293 --> 00:09:23.462
Hey, Dad!"
[ Laughter ]

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:27.399
"I got an idea for our crime!"

00:09:27.399 --> 00:09:28.934
The standout line
from Cohen's account

00:09:28.934 --> 00:09:30.569
of the Trump Tower meeting
is what came next.

00:09:30.569 --> 00:09:33.339
Cohen said he was surprised
Trump would listen to Don Jr.

00:09:33.339 --> 00:09:36.008
because of what Trump had said
about his son behind his back.

00:09:36.008 --> 00:09:39.177
-What struck me as I look back

00:09:39.177 --> 00:09:41.913
and thought about the exchange
between Don Jr.

00:09:41.913 --> 00:09:44.383
and his father was first,

00:09:44.383 --> 00:09:47.119
that Mr. Trump
had frequently told me

00:09:47.119 --> 00:09:50.355
and others that his son Don Jr.

00:09:50.355 --> 00:09:53.191
had the worst judgment
of anyone in the world.

00:09:53.191 --> 00:09:55.194
[ Laughter ]
-Man.

00:09:55.194 --> 00:09:57.429
You know it's bad when you get
dissed for being dumb by the guy

00:09:57.429 --> 00:10:00.933
who threatened his college not
to release his S.A.T. scores.

00:10:00.933 --> 00:10:03.035
"He's dumber than me,
and I'm dumb as a rock."

00:10:03.035 --> 00:10:04.369
[ Laughter ]

00:10:04.369 --> 00:10:06.371
Now, one of the most stunning
things about this hearing

00:10:06.371 --> 00:10:07.640
was seeing the contrast between

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.241
the Republicans
and the Democrats on the panel.

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:11.109
Normally, when you are getting
ready for a big hearing

00:10:11.109 --> 00:10:12.511
like this,
you prepare in advance,

00:10:12.511 --> 00:10:14.613
you come up with a plan,
you coordinate your questions.

00:10:14.613 --> 00:10:18.884
And some of the Democrats were
very focused and prosecutorial.

00:10:18.884 --> 00:10:20.753
-Did the president call you
to coordinate

00:10:20.753 --> 00:10:22.654
on public messaging
about the payments

00:10:22.654 --> 00:10:25.491
to Miss Clifford in
or around February 2018?

00:10:25.491 --> 00:10:27.259
-Yes.
-Was the president interested

00:10:27.259 --> 00:10:30.463
in reducing his local
real-estate bills, tax bills?

00:10:30.463 --> 00:10:31.663
-Yes.

00:10:31.663 --> 00:10:34.433
-Is there any other wrongdoing
or illegal act

00:10:34.433 --> 00:10:37.370
that you are aware
of regarding Donald Trump

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.204
that we haven't
yet discussed today?

00:10:39.204 --> 00:10:41.874
-Yes.
-And now --

00:10:41.874 --> 00:10:44.276
Now let's see how prepared
the Republicans were, like,

00:10:44.276 --> 00:10:47.713
for example, Arizona Republican
Congressman Paul Gosar.

00:10:47.713 --> 00:10:49.782
-There's no truth with you
whatsoever.

00:10:49.782 --> 00:10:52.518
That's why -- That's important
to you, to look up here

00:10:52.518 --> 00:10:55.187
and look at the old adage
that our moms taught us --

00:10:55.187 --> 00:10:57.089
"liar, liar, pants on fire."

00:10:57.089 --> 00:11:00.926
No one should ever listen to you
and to give you credibility.

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:01.994
It's sad.

00:11:01.994 --> 00:11:03.562
It's sad that we have come --

00:11:03.562 --> 00:11:08.567
in fact, I want to quote
the chairman's very words.

00:11:08.567 --> 00:11:11.203
This is a real -- Hold on.

00:11:11.203 --> 00:11:16.008
[ Laughter ]

00:11:16.008 --> 00:11:18.110
-Gentleman's time has expired.
-Sad state.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:22.681
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:22.681 --> 00:11:26.985
-His time expired
while he was looking for it.

00:11:26.985 --> 00:11:28.520
Really hurts
your big, dramatic ending

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.956
when you can't even find
the line you wanted to read.

00:11:30.956 --> 00:11:32.858
It's like if JFK had gotten up
and said,

00:11:32.858 --> 00:11:37.729
"Ask not what your country
can do for you -- ask --

00:11:37.729 --> 00:11:39.765
hold on,
I have it here somewhere."

00:11:39.765 --> 00:11:41.800
[ Laughter ]

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:45.237
"It was here just a minute ago.

00:11:45.237 --> 00:11:48.273
Oh, I guess my time is up."
[ Laughter ]

00:11:48.273 --> 00:11:50.509
Also, maybe when you were
preparing for this hearing,

00:11:50.509 --> 00:11:52.645
you should have spent more time
getting your documents together

00:11:52.645 --> 00:11:54.713
and less time printing up
a giant poster board

00:11:54.713 --> 00:11:57.182
that said
"liar, liar, pants on fire."

00:11:57.182 --> 00:11:59.284
I feel bad for the intern
who had to go to Kinkos

00:11:59.284 --> 00:12:02.888
and print out a giant copy of
Michael Cohen's face.

00:12:02.888 --> 00:12:04.990
Can you imagine what the
employees at Kinkos thought?

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.424
Oh, is this for some kind
of joke?

00:12:06.424 --> 00:12:08.194
No, it's for Congress.

00:12:08.194 --> 00:12:09.361
[ Laughter ]

00:12:09.361 --> 00:12:12.831
This is a thing for Congress.

00:12:12.831 --> 00:12:14.499
Again, you're supposed
to get together

00:12:14.499 --> 00:12:15.768
and plan your questions.

00:12:15.768 --> 00:12:17.335
Clearly, the Republicans
did not do that.

00:12:17.335 --> 00:12:20.005
For example, here is Louisiana
Congressman Clay Higgins,

00:12:20.005 --> 00:12:21.073
who tried to claim

00:12:21.073 --> 00:12:23.675
Cohen was just doing this
to get a TV deal,

00:12:23.675 --> 00:12:25.343
but ended up
embarrassing himself.

00:12:25.343 --> 00:12:30.683
-One of my colleagues asked you
regarding the television deal,

00:12:30.683 --> 00:12:33.886
you expressed wonderment
that your predicament

00:12:33.886 --> 00:12:36.454
could possibly get you
on television.

00:12:36.454 --> 00:12:38.457
It certainly got you
on television today,

00:12:38.457 --> 00:12:39.892
has it not, sir?

00:12:39.892 --> 00:12:42.093
-Sir, I was on television
representing Mr. Trump

00:12:42.093 --> 00:12:44.296
going back into 2011.

00:12:44.296 --> 00:12:46.332
-Well, I didn't know who you
were until today, really.

00:12:46.332 --> 00:12:51.036
[ Laughter ]
-What?! What?!

00:12:51.036 --> 00:12:55.040
You didn't know who Michael
Cohen was until today?

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.175
"You see, sir,
I don't own a TV.

00:12:57.175 --> 00:13:00.679
I get all my news
from a gossipy alligator."

00:13:00.679 --> 00:13:02.547
[ Laughter ]

00:13:02.547 --> 00:13:04.383
Cohen is on the news
all the time.

00:13:04.383 --> 00:13:07.920
there are babies out there whose
first words were Michael Cohen.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.088
[ Laughter ]

00:13:09.088 --> 00:13:10.922
Also, why are you dressed
like that?

00:13:10.922 --> 00:13:13.659
Did you get confused
and think this was a wedding?

00:13:13.659 --> 00:13:14.727
[ Laughter ]

00:13:14.727 --> 00:13:16.194
You look like
one of the groomsmen.

00:13:16.194 --> 00:13:18.931
Did you buy that vest
at Billy Bayou's Bridal Shop?

00:13:18.931 --> 00:13:21.566
And then there was Jim Jordan,

00:13:21.566 --> 00:13:23.335
the guy who accidentally yielded
his time before he was done.

00:13:23.335 --> 00:13:25.003
Jordan tried to
impeach Cohen's character,

00:13:25.003 --> 00:13:26.271
but for the most part

00:13:26.271 --> 00:13:28.373
he just yelled all
the random buzz words you hear

00:13:28.373 --> 00:13:30.375
Fox News pundits
screaming about all day.

00:13:30.375 --> 00:13:32.211
-James Comey, director, fired.

00:13:32.211 --> 00:13:34.914
Andy McCabe,
deputy director, fired.

00:13:34.914 --> 00:13:36.448
Lied three times under oath

00:13:36.448 --> 00:13:38.984
under investigation
right as we speak.

00:13:38.984 --> 00:13:41.453
Jim Baker, FBI counsel,
demoted,

00:13:41.453 --> 00:13:43.389
then left, currently
under investigation by

00:13:43.389 --> 00:13:45.256
the U.S. Attorney's Office
in Connecticut.

00:13:45.256 --> 00:13:47.459
Lisa Page, demoted,
then left.

00:13:47.459 --> 00:13:50.462
Peter Strzok, deputy head
of counterintelligence, demoted,

00:13:50.462 --> 00:13:51.831
then fired.

00:13:51.831 --> 00:13:53.599
-That sounded like
a Fox News version

00:13:53.599 --> 00:13:55.934
of "We Didn't Start the Fire."
[ Laughter ]

00:13:55.934 --> 00:13:58.303
Lisa Page, Peter Strzok,
Benghazi, my shirt's untucked!

00:13:58.303 --> 00:14:00.906
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:00.906 --> 00:14:03.676
It's so -- Donald Trump
didn't start a fire!

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:06.245
[ Applause ]

00:14:06.245 --> 00:14:08.513
It's so obvious that Democrats
got together

00:14:08.513 --> 00:14:10.382
and came up with a plan
for how to question Cohen.

00:14:10.382 --> 00:14:11.784
And Republicans got together
and were like,

00:14:11.784 --> 00:14:13.518
"Okay, Jim, you yell at him.

00:14:13.518 --> 00:14:15.120
Paul, you print out
the poster boards.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.322
And Clay -- Clay,
we're counting on you.

00:14:17.322 --> 00:14:18.356
You ready, Clay?"

00:14:18.356 --> 00:14:20.526
"Oh, I'm more than ready.

00:14:20.526 --> 00:14:22.594
Just one question.

00:14:22.594 --> 00:14:24.062
Who is Michael Cohen?"

00:14:24.062 --> 00:14:25.563
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:25.563 --> 00:14:28.200
"I'm ready to dance!"

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:32.704
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:14:32.704 --> 00:14:35.107
Today we witnessed something
truly rare and historic.

00:14:35.107 --> 00:14:37.309
One of the President's
closest personal confidantes

00:14:37.309 --> 00:14:39.378
detailing Trump's alleged crimes
and personal failings

00:14:39.378 --> 00:14:40.813
for the entire world to see.

00:14:40.813 --> 00:14:43.382
This hearing also showed that
Republicans are supporting Trump

00:14:43.382 --> 00:14:46.118
despite the fact there is still
so much we don't know about him.

00:14:46.118 --> 00:14:47.686
If Donald Trump himself
were called

00:14:47.686 --> 00:14:49.054
to testify before Congress,

00:14:49.054 --> 00:14:50.655
at least one Republican
would say...

00:14:50.655 --> 00:14:53.158
-Well, I didn't know who you
were until today, really.

00:14:53.158 --> 00:14:55.427
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

